 "remarks": "Charming 4 bedroom, 2 bath Cape nestled on a quiet street in Stamford's sought after Cove neighborhood. This bright and sunny home offers classic charm with thoughtful updates throughout. Hardwood floors complement the inviting living spaces and the large eat-in kitchen provides plenty of room for everyday living and entertaining. The kitchen has brand new flooring and lighting. Both bathrooms feature new flooring, vanities and lighting, adding a fresh, modern touch. A walk-out basement leads out to a large, level yard with plenty of room for gardening, play, entertaining, or simply relaxing. Ideally located in the desirable Cove area, this warm and welcoming home is a wonderful opportunity to enjoy all that Stamford has to offer.",
